# SlingDePIN Phase 0 — Demo & Selling Point Guide
### Project Clarity | Live Production Deployment | May 2026

---

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Infrastructure Status (as of May 25, 2026)**
> The full Phase 0 stack is deployed and live. The MOQ relay node is running on AWS EC2 (`54.80.47.153`) and accepting QUIC connections on port 4443. Smart contracts are deployed on Base Sepolia testnet.

---

## Part 1: What We Are Demonstrating

SlingDePIN proves **four things simultaneously** that no pitch deck can:

| # | Proof Point | The Problem It Solves | The Proof |
|---|-------------|----------------------|-----------|
| 1 | **Sub-500ms ad insertion via QUIC/MOQ** | Sling TV's HLS creates 2–10s black screens at every ad break | Side-by-side: MOQ switches in <300ms, HLS takes 3–8 seconds |
| 2 | **Per-impression x402 payment on Base** | Advertisers pay CPMs on the honor system with zero cryptographic receipt | Each ad break fires a USDC micropayment with a Basescan transaction hash |
| 3 | **On-chain SLA delivery proof** | 30% of CTV ad inventory is fraudulent (Morgan Stanley, 2026) | Every delivery writes a proof to `DeliveryOracle.sol` — auditable by anyone |
| 4 | **DePIN node earns CMXS token reward** | No economic model for edge infrastructure operators | Node wallet receives 0.001 CMXS per verified delivery, visible on-chain |

