└── Next.js 15 dashboard   → Connected to Base Sepolia + AWS node
```

### 2.2 MOQ Relay Certificate

The relay uses a self-signed TLS certificate (required for QUIC):
```
Fingerprint: e87bf6d1e20053769c3a1e300e87b2d3d2bc47662b567b862b06cd5f8969f652
Relay URL:   https://54.80.47.153:4443
```

Clients bypass standard TLS verification using the pinned fingerprint — standard practice for QUIC/WebTransport nodes using self-signed certs (browsers accept it via `serverCertificateHashes` in the WebTransport API).

