## Part 3: Running the Demo — Step by Step

### Prerequisites Checklist

- [ ] Chrome 120+ (Safari does not support WebTransport yet)
- [ ] A funded Base Sepolia wallet (MetaMask or Coinbase Wallet)
  - Base Sepolia ETH: https://www.alchemy.com/faucets/base-sepolia
  - Testnet USDC: https://faucet.circle.com → select Base Sepolia
- [ ] Access to the Vercel dashboard URL
- [ ] SSH access to EC2 for live log tailing (optional but impressive in front of engineers)

---

### Step 1: Verify the Node is Live (2 min before demo)

```bash
ssh -i your-key.pem ubuntu@54.80.47.153 "docker logs clarity-moq-relay --tail 5"
```

Expected output (**node is healthy**):
```
INFO moq_relay: listening addr=[::]:4443
INFO moq_relay::jemalloc: jemalloc heap profiling is active
INFO moq_relay::cluster: running as root, accepting leaf nodes
```

Also verify Grafana at `http://54.80.47.153:3000` (login: admin / admin).

