### For Sling / EchoStar Engineering Leadership

| Their Objection | Our Response | Demo Evidence |
|----------------|-------------|---------------|
| "Can't fix black screen without replacing HLS" | MOQ/QUIC runs as a **parallel transport layer** — no rip-and-replace. Phase 1 runs both side-by-side in the same product. | Demo shows MOQ running alongside HLS simultaneously |
| "QUIC is immature for production" | We use `kixelated/moq-rs` — the IETF reference implementation, authored by the spec co-editor. Cloudflare runs it in production today. | Live relay on EC2, confirmed QUIC connections |
| "How does it integrate with our ad server?" | The x402 gateway is a **sidecar** between the ad decisioning engine and the player. One API swap. DSP/SSP integrations are untouched. | x402 gateway running as a separate Docker service |

