## Appendix C: Emergency Recovery During a Live Demo

```bash
# Option 1: GitHub Actions re-deploy (push any commit)
git commit --allow-empty -m "chore: re-deploy" && git push

# Option 2: SSH manual restart (~30 seconds)
ssh -i key.pem ubuntu@54.80.47.153
cd /home/ubuntu/project-clarity/packages/node
docker compose -f docker-compose.node.yml restart

# Verify recovery
docker logs clarity-moq-relay --tail 5
```

Expected healthy output:
```
INFO moq_relay: listening addr=[::]:4443
INFO moq_relay::cluster: running as root, accepting leaf nodes
```
